      (e1) shifted kernel      C_eff = C_0 finite     -> well-posed iff C_0 < (2 - alpha_c)/alpha_c = 6.250e+08, i.e. y_r > 2.56e-18 (alpha_c = 3.20e-09)
      (e2), (e3), (H) cut-off  C_eff = 0 exactly      -> E = alpha_c, w^2/k^2 = c_2*(2 - alpha_c)/(alpha_c*(3*c_2 + 2)) > 0: GR + BPS khronon (FP5 C5's cone)
      G_eff/G on FRW = (1 + C_eff)/(1 - alpha_c (1 + C_eff)/2) -> -2/(alpha_c - 2) at C_eff = 0 (FP2 D3); slip psi/n = 1 for every C_eff (K5)
